Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:04.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傷腦筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們怎麼跟你說的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說禁止一切招募部員的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那算是怎麼一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為演劇部正在休部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}社團活動也處於中止狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:21.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以無法給予張貼招募部員海報的許可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼可能有這麼荒唐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道就那樣乖乖地接受了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:28.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我雖然也有努力爭取過
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他們說規定就是規定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:42.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要放棄 一定還有什麼方法才對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:43.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果沒有 那也要創造出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:48.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別為了這種事就放棄你的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:49.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:51.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:30.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道在跟那個演劇部的女生交往嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然你參加社團這件事本身就很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:36.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果是這樣的話 我就能理解了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:42.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其實呢 那傢伙家裡是開麵包店的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:46.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她媽媽做的麵包非常的好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃過一次以後那味道便足以將人俘虜了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果跟她搞好關係 那麵包就可以隨便吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:54.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:57.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不然我怎麼可能會跟演劇部扯上關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:01.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 想想看也確實不是和你相稱的類型啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起來又樸素 又認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:07.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只需要好好考慮報復坂上智代的方法就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:08.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可真是纏人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天只是來見見你而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為智代你是個美女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:23.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這話簡直無法讓人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:28.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好了 我忘了帶下節課要用的胸部了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:30.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}智代 把你的胸部借給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:31.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:33.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了 上釣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:35.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也聽到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她既然問了「為什麼」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就表明那是可以借給別人的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:44.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說 智代的胸部是可以隨意裝卸的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼可能取的下來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:47.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再說了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:49.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再說了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:51.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有要用到胸部的課程嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:56.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是一點破綻都沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:58.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道還想繼續啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看著吧 下次我一定會…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 發現大怪人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我不是個怪人 所以跟我沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大怪人你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來是在說我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是當然了 你是個很稀有的大怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:19.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或許說你是十年難得一遇的大怪人也不為過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 肯定不為過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:25.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:29.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是三年D班的岡崎朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這小朋友是誰啊 你認識的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 大怪人竟然有兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:36.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到底哪兒奇怪了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}頭髮是不可能有的顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這孩子初次見面就能說出如此失禮的話來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:46.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子只是想跟大怪人說話而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和你單獨說下話 請跟我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到這兒附近就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要說的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:54.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大怪人竟然有兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為是你叫我跟來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子想要說話的對象是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是也叫我大怪人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是頭髮奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是「存在」就很奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這孩子絕對是想找人打架
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:14.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可是連「存在」都奇怪的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一部分奇怪的你要好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次我就放過你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 大怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:24.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以說了別那麼叫我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的名字我忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎啊 岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:32.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 岡崎同學 你有什麼想對風子說的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.01,0:05:33.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要說的話？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:34.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:37.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}ONE TWO
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}ONE TWO ONE TWO
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:39.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 不要這樣啦 太糟糕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:41.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是禮物的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天交給你的這個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個原來是禮物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:46.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那真是謝謝你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:50.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子的姐姐馬上就要結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:57.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對方是一個叫做祐介的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能一起來祝賀他們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:02.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝賀風子的姐姐新婚愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:03.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了啊 我不是祝賀過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:09.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你在他們婚禮的當天為他們祝賀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:10.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在禮堂上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:12.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說 因為你已經把禮物送給我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以要我出席你姐姐的結婚典禮嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:16.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:17.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼我要…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再說我跟你也不怎麼熟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:26.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子的姐姐直到三年前都一直在這所學校當美術老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:30.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子想要大家祝賀姐姐結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以才在到處分發禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:35.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要從頭發到尾嗎 給這學校裡的學生們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:36.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果得到了這麼可愛的東西的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家一定都會感動的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這麼可愛的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:02.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總覺得剛剛鼻子的感覺好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然沒有讓她吸進去嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:08.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個啊 我覺得是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你指的什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:14.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐在這裡任教已經是三年前的事情了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:18.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 現在的學生應該都不認識她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:21.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我認為應該沒人會那麼好事去參加陌生人的婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:23.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然會是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是三年級的學生 滿腦子都是升學考試
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 風子會加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:34.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為希望大家都能祝賀姐姐結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:40.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別看我這個樣子 其實也是很忙的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:43.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也沒有閒工夫忙這些事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次的我可不一樣了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你每次不都是那麼說的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次真的不一樣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:58.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事吧 你這樣都讓我不由自主就全力踢上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:01.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是不錯的一踢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:04.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打完架後要和好 稍微陪我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次又是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:10.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 好了 稍微過去一下而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們到底想做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:17.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居然想把我帶進男廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:19.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想進行騷擾也得有個限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:22.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若無其事地把你帶進男廁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:25.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因為想驗證你到底是不是女生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:30.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為你實在太強大了 所以他在懷疑你是不是男的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:34.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道不生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起生氣 更多的是震驚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:42.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本以為我在這所學校的言行舉止和普通女生是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這感性認識還真是挺厲害的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:50.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我其實也在努力嘗試著改變自己呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 別以為這樣就算完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:04.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打起精神來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 想不到好辦法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不靠張貼海報 而是直接交到學生的手上如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:14.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我問過了 但好像也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:18.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是搞簽名活動什麼的 估計也不會進展順利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們的事我都知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要來幫忙招募部員？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 因為我已經吃膩了學校食堂的麵包了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是…麵包嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:36.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 只是我在自言自語罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:41.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說起來 學生會不是來阻礙招募部員了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不就很簡單了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什麼好辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:48.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把學生會長叫到學校後院
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後全部人一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:55.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可以這樣做的 學生會的人又沒做錯什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:58.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這不是最直截了當的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總之 不可以使用暴力的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那和他們商量嗎 我最不擅長的就是這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:07.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}價值觀差距好大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:09.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有這份心意我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:11.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請務必幫我的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}OK 交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這如果是角色扮演遊戲的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:21.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}春原陽平想要成為伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:22.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:25.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(435,100)\fs22}斬
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:25.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(435,200)\fs22}放煙霧彈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:25.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(435,300)\fs22}用魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:32.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼沒有成為伙伴的選項啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的話就很簡單的說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:38.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我覺得只是我們自己煩惱的話不會有什麼進展
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 不如找別人去商量一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:44.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說不定真是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:45.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什麼人可以商量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:48.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然了 否則怎麼會說出這種話來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:53.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牡丹 又跑過來玩了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:57.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不好辦啊 還有課沒上完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:11:01.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}過一會兒把朋也或者陽平抓來看著它就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像有提到我們的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:08.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我是想班長的話應該會很熟悉校規的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但和她老姐在一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去把妹妹單獨叫來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:17.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果說有人想向她告白的話 老姐也會迴避的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來如此呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們在說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只要想著怎麼去提問就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:30.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請問…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有事情想找你的人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:33.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:40.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是三年B班的古河渚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:43.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常抱歉這麼唐突地把你叫出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:47.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我是D班的藤林椋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在擔任班長吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:50.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:56.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好厲害 我完全做不到 所以我很仰慕你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 沒有什麼了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:02.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有話要對你說 能聽我說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:03.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的感情是非常認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以的話 也請你認真地給她答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:10.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:14.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 我沒有想到會是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:19.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和性別沒什麼關係吧 重要的是那顆熾熱的心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你偶爾也會說句好話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為從本質上來講 我是個好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是女孩子很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 古河同學真的非常可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但和我的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 怎麼說好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直在猶豫…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我決定拿出勇氣來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你思考得那麼深刻…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:45.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真讓人興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已經不知道該怎麼做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:50.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請無論如何都要聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:54.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也會認真傾聽你的話的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請無論如何 無論如何也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:03.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請無論如何也要幫我重建演劇部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:04.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:09.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 你們這些傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:17.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然敢戲弄我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:24.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是這樣的話 早點說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:26.77,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是春原不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:27.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:30.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 都是因為我不擅長說明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 讓人有點心跳不已呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:37.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 除了這兩個東西以外就沒有朋友了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你說朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:43.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們說要幫我重建演劇部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:46.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正肯定又在打什麼鬼主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說 要不放棄這些傢伙 和我們交個朋友算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牡丹也是這麼想的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說的真不留口德啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:59.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}實際上你的目標是麵包吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 雖然很感謝這份心意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:06.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也不能就這樣拋棄一直都來幫忙的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:10.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學和春原同學都是很好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好像很好地收買了她嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道說你是在追她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這怎麼可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:22.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要重建處於休部狀態的社團需要的首先是人數
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:27.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}校規上說社團活動最少需要三名部員以及一名顧問
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:30.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三個人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}關鍵的問題就在於被禁止募集部員了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人頭的數量不是足夠了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:40.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她 你 還有你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:51.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別開玩笑了 我們怎麼可能會對演戲有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:52.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算不能貼傳單和海報
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:59.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普通地去面對面招募的話是沒有問題的麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小哥 真令人意外
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:04.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是真心打算幫她嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:07.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然了 不是真心的話就拿不到麵包了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:10.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要不要也認真地幫小渚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她看上去是個誠實的好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:15.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成為朋友的話上學也會變得快樂些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 明天對智代一定要擊出個本壘打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:21.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你每天都這麼歡樂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:23.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本壘打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:25.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忽然之間怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 只是我在自言自語
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:30.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要持續到什麼時候啊 這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:34.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天真的不一樣了 我已經改變對你的看法了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.77,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 稱讚她戴在身上的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:40.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你戴在頭上的那東西很合適你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:43.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美男計呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:49.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已經承認智代是女孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼只要利用這一點就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是被她討厭得一塌糊塗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以說才需要你的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:16:00.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好像和智代很談得來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:01.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 至少比你好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以說 給我一點建議嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能博得智代好感的話題什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:09.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}制服也很適合你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很噁心耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:13.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}進展順利嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:14.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:17.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後自然地伸著懶腰說道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:21.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「啊 智代長的這麼漂亮 一定很受歡迎的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:25.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 智代長的這麼漂亮 一定很受歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:26.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的說了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有沒有被我吸引到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:29.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後自然地下蹲著說道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:35.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「不知道怎麼我忽然想找個女朋友了」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道怎麼我忽然想找個女朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 十分不自然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:41.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後以打保齡球的姿勢說道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「請你每天早上都為我做早餐吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}智代同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:53.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請你每天早上都為我做早餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:16:59.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這些姿勢有什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:00.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:02.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有的話就不要讓我做嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼啊 果然是在耍我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:08.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先下手為強
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連續技發動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 一不小心就踢回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:24.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:27.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的請你們到此為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.08,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍等一下 智代
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你對演戲有興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:33.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在招募部員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:37.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能穿上那些女孩子最喜歡的禮服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然有點興趣 但還是不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為馬上就要選舉學生會長了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:46.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我並沒有時間進行社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:47.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}學生會長？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以後會越來越忙的 你還是找別人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:54.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}學生會長呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:57.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 一之瀨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:01.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一之瀨同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:05.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讀得好快啊 不愧是天才少女
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 一之瀨琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:10.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琴美同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:13.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:17.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小琴美？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:23.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是三年D班的岡崎朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:25.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是A班的一之瀨同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:30.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 三個平假名的 琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一之瀨琴美吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:32.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很有名呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:35.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫我的時候叫小琴美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少讓我直接叫名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:43.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不要來一起看書
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:45.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是來看書的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:49.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不要吃便當
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:53.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天是來招募部員的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:55.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你對演戲有興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.51,0:18:59.03,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在正在招集部員
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是去掛個名字也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:03.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:07.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一種不可思議的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:11.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:14.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 不用特意去拉這麼長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:19.80,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我下次再來 你好好考慮一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:21.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:22.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:24.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:29.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那邊也沒收穫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:34.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 雖然問了不少人 但沒有一個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:35.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔細想想的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:39.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因為沒人想要演戲 所以才會休部的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:43.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想得太簡單了 實際上很艱難呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三年級學生還有升學考試
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:51.19,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年級和二年級的學生說不定會有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:53.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年級的學生嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:19:59.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喲 你還在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:01.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 大怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:06.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初次見面 我是三年B班的古河渚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:12.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子同學 你對演戲有興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:13.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:15.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在正在招募部員
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:18.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你剛上一年級 還沒有參加社團活動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:23.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子很忙的 沒有時間參加社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:27.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要這麼說嘛 你又不是從早到晚都在做這個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從早到晚都在做這個 一直在這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:32.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然是這麼說 但總要回家的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不回去的 一直都在學校裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 狡辯也要有個限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:43.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才沒有說謊 風子一直都在學校裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.99,0:20:46.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從早到晚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:47.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.23,0:20:48.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不回家去的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:51.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算回去 也沒有任何意義
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:00.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你莫非是離家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}風子也不清楚自己為什麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:10.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在入學典禮後的回家路上 好像被汽車撞到…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:12.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醒過來後就在學校裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.06,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被汽車？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:15.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請問 風子同學
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:17.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的姓是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊吹 我叫伊吹風子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊吹…風子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊吹老師的妹妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:31.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 有認識我姐姐的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說起來你留過級呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:38.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我一年級時的美術老師
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:39.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:47.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她妹妹應該是遇到交通事故 並一直住在醫院裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:54.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天來買麵包的時候也說是剛探望過妹妹才回來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:58.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學 你有聽說過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:01.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有關遇到交通事故的學生的幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:03.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:00.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臉色好像稍微好了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:01:01.95,OC,,0,0,0,,{\move(960,4.5,960,34.5)\fad(460,425)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}做了一個夢  一個晶瑩剔透的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:09.33,OC,,0,0,0,,{\move(900,12,1020,12)\fad(420,420)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}一個縹緲卻又永恆的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:14.95,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,400)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5}如清風般輕聲的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:22.47,OC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,4680)\be1\1c&H00867469\3c&H00D1C1B5\move(960,4.5,960,34.5,2000,6680)}在高空呼喚著我
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.42,0:01:26.12,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00463E20\3c&H00A1B36E}若是就此飛向天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.39,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00DF9535\3c&H00F0D9C3}若是就此飛向天空
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.65,0:01:32.15,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,400)\be1\1c&H00DF9535\3c&H00F0D9C3}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:35.69,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(400,500)\be1\1c&H0010431E\3c&H0042BC70}無論何處都能到達
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:42.12,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00607BAE\3c&H007EB7D6}在那牽繫在一起的雙手間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:48.76,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00AB969E\3c&H00C9C1C1}若能尋覓到那小小的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:55.48,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H006177B8\3c&H00C9ACB1}在光芒中搖曳著的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:02:01.54,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H000E1312\3c&H00A8B0B0}所有話語和思念
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:14.58,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,200)\be1\1c&H00566060\3c&H00C5E5F0}都必將 毫無保留地 傳遞給 身在遠方的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:21.68,OC,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,12)\fad(200,1000)\be1\1c&H00617EB1\3c&H00BDBBEF}都必將 毫無保留地 傳遞給 身在遠方的你
